    "copy": "CIBC set out to modernise its mobile banking app, making everyday banking simpler, more intuitive and accessible for millions of customers.\n\nThrough workshops, customer journey mapping and usability testing, the work focused on simplifying complex banking tasks, improving navigation and creating a more consistent experience.\n\nWorking closely with designers, researchers and CIBC stakeholders, we developed and tested concepts, refined key interactions and established a cohesive design direction for a customer-centred banking experience at scale.",
